{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2022-02-25 09:00:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS INITIATES $200 MILLION ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE AGREEMENT', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., FEB. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ: SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE AGREEMENT (ASR) WITH WELLS FARGO BANK, NA TO REPURCHASE AN AGGREGATE OF $200 MILLION OF SYNOPSYS STOCK.'}